    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir43">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e98">Caput 43</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_1@1-1">Altitudinis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir43-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir43-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">pulchritudo firmamenti</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nullus corporeis oculis divinitatis splendorem potest sufferre.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e124">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_3@12-13">Fornacem custodiens.</quote>
            Quia superbos, pro cogitatione, locutione, et operatione mala, excruciat aeterna flamma.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e135">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_5@6-9">Et in sermonibus ejus,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir43-Rd1e142"><name xml:id="gom-sir43-Nd1e143" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e146"><pb ed="#P" n="1225B"/> Mysticis verbis superborum ludit intellectum.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_5@10-10">Festinavit,</quote>
            etc. Cum in praedicatione Evangelii praeparata est via salutis et aditus regni coelestis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e158">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e160">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e162">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e164" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_6@1-2">Et luna,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir43-Rd1e167"><name xml:id="gom-sir43-Nd1e168" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e171"><seg type="qs">Postquam de sole disputavit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed rectius aprili deputatur, quia in ipso vel incipit, vel desinit, vel totus includitur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e181">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e183">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e185">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e187" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_7@6-8">Luminare quod minuitur,</quote>
            etc. Luna non habet nativum splendorem, sed a sole accipit: sic et Ecclesia a Christo, quae in persecutione videtur minui, sed in parte clarescit; crescit enim mirabiliter in consummatione.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e194">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_9@1-2">Vas castrorum,</quote>
            etc. Quia in ipsa consistit multitudo fidelium, quae in firmamento veritatis et divinae praedicationis per totum orbem gloriose <pb ed="#P" n="1225C"/> resplendet.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e205">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e207">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e209">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e211" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_10@1-2">Species coeli,</quote>
            etc. Ornatus Ecclesiae, sanctorum plenitudo, quos Deus excelsus ordinavit, ut praedicatione Evangelii illustrarent. Hi <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e214" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_11@1-3">in verbis sanctis</quote> et in doctrina verae fidei permanentes, exspectant judicium Dei.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e219">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e221">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e223">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e225" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_11@1-2">In verbis.</quote>
            Quia in patientia sua possident animas, praecincti lumbos; et lucernas tenentes in manibus suis, exspectant Dominum suum, quando revertatur a nuptiis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e230">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e232">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e234">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e236" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_12@1-2">Vide arcum,</quote>
            etc. Scriptum Veteris vel Novi Testamenti. Hic fidelibus suave jugum ostenditur, contumacibus arma terribilia.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e241">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e243">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e245">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e247" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_13@1-2">Gyravit coelum,</quote>
            etc. Quando per virtutem et sapientiam Dei, id est, Christum, Vetus et <pb ed="#P" n="1225D"/> Novum Testamentum conditum est.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e255">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e257">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e259">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e261" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_16@6-10">Et confracti sunt lapides grandinis.</quote>
            Doctores, qui terram humani cordis irrigant, et tempestatem increpationis in se gerunt, et in tempore effundunt, et confringunt lapides grandinis; increpando, scilicet duritiam pravi cordis lapident vitale gramen.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e266">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e268">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e270">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e272" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_17@10-11">Aspirabit Notus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir43-Rd1e275"><name xml:id="gom-sir43-Nd1e276" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e279"><seg type="qs">Qui et Auster</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">potentes ad Christiani nominis persecutionem, et aliquando ad poenitentiam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e288">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e290">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e292">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e294" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_18@6-6">Tempestas.</quote>
            Varia tentamenta per malignos spiritus Deus irrogat, ut fervorem fidei et dilectionem frigescere faciant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e299">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e301">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e303">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e305" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_21@1-3">Gelu sicut salem,</quote>
            etc. Id est, sterilitatem; <pb ed="#P" n="1226A"/> ubi enim sal spargitur, sterilitas sequitur: diabolus vero per frigus infidelitatis terrena corda ad bona opera sterilia facit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e312">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e314">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e316">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e318" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_24@1-1">Medicina,</quote>
            etc. Omnis eloquentia deficit in comparatione ejus, nec sufficit virtutem ejus enarrare.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e323">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e325">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e327">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e329" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_26@1-3">Qui navigant mare,</quote>
            etc. Multa sunt ad litteram pericula maris, et ibi mirabilia Dei opera in variis bestiis, sicut naturalium rerum scriptores tradiderunt. In mari quoque hujus mundi sunt multa monstra daemoniorum et multae eorum insidiae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir43-Dd1e335">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir43-Hd1e337">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir43-d1e339">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e341" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir43_34@5-6">Ne laboretis,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir43-Rd1e344"><name xml:id="gom-sir43-Nd1e345" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir43-Qd1e348">Comprehendere quod est incomprehensibile. Unde non quaeras opes ad quas pertingere non possis.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
